<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets $150 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets $150 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    15.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.984   PAY DATE  S 15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.834    SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
